                                                "sense_id": "3bf809d5-94d6-32a9-b64e-aa376b4fdf01",
                                                "text": "Shew me a token foꝛ good, that they which hate me may ſee it, and bee aſhamed: becauſe thou, Lord, haſt holpen me, and comfoꝛted me."
                                            }
                                        ]
